    "detailed_description": "This game places you at the helm of a cutting-edge space fighter, navigating through the vastness of a starry backdrop.<br />\r\n Rendered in full 3D high-definition graphics, every planet and nebula is intricately depicted, creating breathtaking cosmic vistas. With immersive sound effects, from the roar of engines to the sizzling sparks of laser impacts, every detail transports you into the heart of space. Players maneuver with WASD keys for agile movement and steer precisely with the mouse, relishing in the high-speed flight and intense firefights at their fingertips. Diverse missions range from escorting convoys to decimating enemy fleets, testing both strategy and reflexes. Get ready, space adventurer, your journey is to the stars and beyond!",
